1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:09,126
Many older adults deal with cataracts, glaucoma, or severe presbyopia, making standard phone text nearly impossible to read.

2
00:00:09,126 --> 00:00:14,475
PNCC Care follows the highest international accessibility standard—WCAG AAA.

3
00:00:14,475 --> 00:00:23,061
In the accessibility settings, users can drag a font size slider to enlarge text up to more than double its standard size.

4
00:00:23,061 --> 00:00:36,152
We also built an OLED high-contrast mode with a pitch-black background and bright white typography, achieving a 12:1 contrast ratio that remains crystal clear even under bright sunlight.
